  (no_connect (at 210.82 83.82000000000001) (uuid 33604e5a-32cc-584b-90d7-84d6cf5bebe5))
  (no_connect (at 378.46 83.82000000000001) (uuid ba8c322e-54f0-5150-b2a0-9eaaa50e4cd7))
  (no_connect (at 464.82 154.94) (uuid aa466579-8d31-5d6f-854d-d028f4cc0968))
  (no_connect (at 464.82 157.48000000000002) (uuid ba39502c-d076-5805-a829-162358333120))

  (text "Notes\nJ13: one 4-way plug for both field supplies (12 A per contact): A = bank A, inputs, pump (about 10 A); B = bank B and relays (about 8 A). Link A and B in the plug for a single supply\nF12: bank A, inputs, ribbons\nF13: pump\nF14: bank B, relays\nD21: unidirectional TVS: surge clamp, and blows the fuse on reverse polarity\nU17: pump logic 5 V, field side\nU18: pinout checked (31 Oct)"
    (at 15.24 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid edf7d400-f08b-51e6-8775-eb69d40ca446)
  )
  (text "\nU21: about 4 A pump supply with current limit; can PWM a brushed motor to 1 kHz. CHECK rating once the 107Z current is known\nR148: diagnostic, test point only\nD26: motor freewheel\nR150: pump PWM: 24 V push-pull, 20 Hz-25 kHz. 1k makes the output survive a short to 0 V or 24 V for ever (24 mA, 0.6 W). CHECK the 107Z input current (high level = 24 V - 1k x I)\nR152: pump DIR: 24 V push-pull, 20 Hz-25 kHz. 1k makes the output survive a short to 0 V or 24 V for ever (24 mA, 0.6 W). CHECK the 107Z input current (high level = 24 V - 1k x I)\nD27: clamp to the 5 V rail\nR155: 1.5 V threshold"
    (at 203.2 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid b5ef58e7-64bb-5236-9de5-74abd8a03659)
  )
  (text "\nU24: CHECK pin order for the SOT-23-5 variant\nR157: hysteresis\nJP2: fit for an open-collector tacho\nJ15: one plug for the whole pump: power, 0 V, PWM, DIR, tacho, signal 0 V (Thomas 107Z: signal ground must be field 0 V)\nF15: per-channel limit: a shorted coil wire trips only its own PTC\nU25: 60 V, 400 mA PhotoMOS: rides out a short until its PTC trips. CHECK with a 10 s short test\nR164: 5 V -> 3.4 V"
    (at 391.16 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6a110229-de4c-5330-9173-7083e93feddc)
  )

